      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When you set the [`vertexDescriptor`](mdlmesh/vertexdescriptor.md) property of a [`MDLMesh`](mdlmesh.md) object, the mesh automatically formats its vertex buffers to match the new descriptor.",
